y to wait and potentially move out of the milestone.\\n\\n- Optimized locking for metric aggregation:\\n\\n  - Status: Work in progress by David; awaiting one more testing PR before starting locking improvements.\\n\\n  - Context: Approach reviewed informally with Josh McDonald; thought reasonably good.\\n\\n  - Testing PR: “Add concurrent-safe tests for metric aggregation” needs more reviews.\\n\\n  - Notes: A test-run issue caused confusion around time ordering; not a fundamental `time.Now` issue. Go 1.25 testing time manipulation may help if needed.\\n\\n- Exporter: Prometheus migrate to new configuration options:\\n\\n  - Status: On David’s list.\\n\\n  - Scope: Expected to be a one-line default change; no “Help Wanted” needed.\\n\\n- Improved error handling:\\n\\n  - Status: PR was in draft and author became inactive.\\n\\n  - Decision: Remove from milestone; consider pinging the author. Should not block release.\\n\\n- High mutex contention in metric sums:\\n\\n  - Status: Assigned to David; actively being fixed.\\n\\n- Observability packages:\\n\\n  - Status: Multiple PRs open and being reworked.\\n\\n  - Release impact: Not critical for upcoming release; if they block, move them out.\\n\\n  - Activity: Some PRs show movement; Tyler is actively working on one; others have limited updates.\\n\\n- Prometheus exporter: Optimize return times:\\n\\n  - Status: Worth review for those working on observability metrics.\\n\\n  - Context: Already merged for the standard trace exporter.\\n\\n  - Note: Awaiting minimum time requirement (~23 minutes) before completion.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-01]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-10-10\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3389930076  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-10T12:53:12Z · **Updated**: 2025-10-10T12:54:14Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-09-25\\n\\n**Attendees:**\\n\\n- 