\"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2697451053729755, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.06768441053282223, \"vector_similarity\": 0.74122006, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3389930076.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"872f2dca8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3389930076.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3389930076.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 4478, \"chunk_count\": 3, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:33\", \"token_count\": 1509, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"  - Group: Review and approve the PR.\\n\\n### 4) PR: Counter performance improvements; benchmarks and exemplar behavior\\n\\n- Summary:\\n\\n  - Significant optimization work on synchronous metric paths:\\n\\n    - Use sync.Map for attribute-set storage to improve read-heavy performance.\\n\\n    - Atomic sum values; “hot-cold” waitgroup technique to make measurements lockless and enable safe resets for delta aggregations (inspired by Prometheus histogram patterns).\\n\\n  - Known implications:\\n\\n    - Attribute-set limit becomes a soft limit due to race in attribute-set creation (map size tracking vs. map updates).\\n\\n    - For cumulative aggregations, enforcing attribute limits deterministically is harder since state persists; care needed to avoid inconsistent drops.\\n\\n    - Exemplar behavior: an Add may be included in the metric points but its exemplar may not be recorded in the same batch, which is acceptable and consistent with Prometheus and exemplar sampling design.\\n\\n- Discussion highlights:\\n\\n  - Potential follow-up: for exemplar reservoirs, a “merge” API could enable hot-cold reservoir consolidation for stricter atomicity at a higher level.\\n\\n  - Future performance work: histogram improvements and sharding (e.g., per-CPU) to reduce contention further.\\n\\n  - Benchmarks indicate substantial gains: ~10x for histograms with no contention; ~3x for fixed-size with shared contention.\\n\\n- Decisions:\\n\\n  - Accept current approach; exemplar variability is acceptable under spec/practice.\\n\\n  - Prioritize reviews for the benchmark PR and counter performance PR; histograms/fixed-size follow after.\\n\\n- Action items:\\n\\n  - David:\\n\\n    - Finalize and sequence PRs: benchmark fix (includes bug fix), counter performance improvements, then histogram/fixed-size improvements.\\n\\n    - Document soft-limit behavior and any mitigation for cumulative aggregations.\\n\\n  - Tyler/Group: Review benchmark PR and counter performance PR first; provide feedback and approvals.\\n\\n  - Tyler: Consider options to tie map-size accounting to updates more atomically; follow up with comments/ideas.\\n\\n## Decisions (summary)\\n\\n- Ownership and ops first: Establish clear owner, access, notifications, and playbooks for go.opentelemetry.io; explore migration to Netlify/Hugo only with owners’ approval.\\n\\n- Scope naming: Use instrumentation library name per spec; later add an attribute for the instrumented component/package (track via semantic conventions).\\n\\n- Error types: Adopt domain-specific error.type where available; proceed after GoDoc verification.\\n\\n- Performance work: Accept exemplar sampling variability; proceed with benchmark and counter performance PRs; histograms/fixed-size next.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"group review and approv the pr 4 pr counter perform improv benchmark and exemplar behavior summari signific optim work on synchron metric path use sync map for attribut set storag to improv read heavi perform atom sum valu hot cold waitgroup techniqu to make measur lockless and enabl safe reset for delta aggreg inspir by prometheus histogram pattern known implic attribut set limit becom a soft limit due to race in attribut set creation map size track v map updat for cumul aggreg enforc attribut limit determinist is harder sinc state persist care need to avoid inconsist drop exemplar behavior an add may be includ in the metric point but it exemplar may not be record in the same batch which is accept and consist with prometheus and exemplar sampl design discuss highlight potenti follow up for exemplar reservoir a merg api could enabl hot cold reservoir consolid for stricter atom at a higher level futur perform work histogram improv and shard e g per cpu to reduc content further benchmark indic substanti gain 10x for histogram with no content 3x for fix size with share content decis accept current approach exemplar variabl is accept under spec practic priorit review for the benchmark pr and counter perform pr histogram fix size follow after action item david final and sequenc pr benchmark fix includ bug fix counter perform improv then histogram fix size improv document soft limit behavior and ani mitig for cumul aggreg tyler group review benchmark pr and counter perform pr first provid feedback and approv tyler consid option to tie map size account to updat more atom follow up with comment idea decis summari ownership and op first establish clear owner access notif and playbook for go opentelemetri io explor migrat to netlifi hugo onli with owner approv scope name use instrument librari name per spec later add an attribut for the instrument compon packag track via semant convent error type adopt domain specif error type where avail proceed after godoc verif perform work accept exemplar sampl variabl proceed with benchmark and counter perform pr histogram fix size next\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"873c8ee88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3389972183.md\", \"id\": \"02ccee9348ecfe4c\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.26751826237297555, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.06768441053282223, \"vector_similarity\": 0.73379725, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3389972183.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"873c8ee88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3389972183.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3389972183.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 8301, \"chunk_count\": 7, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:30\", \"token_count\": 3187, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"  - Seek more engagement from gRPC; attempt in-person conversations at KubeCon if possible. David will sync with Josh on outreach.\\n\\n- Conclusion: Not likely to stabilize this year; set a goal to finalize a strategy next year once semconv progress is clearer.\\n\\nReferences:\\n\\n- [Stabilization of otelgrpc](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/8078)?\\n\\n  - Related: [https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8265](https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8265)  \\n\\n  - We need the semconv to stabilize  \\n\\n  - There needs to be involvement from gRPC to progress this  \\n\\n  - [David] Update: I’m told that the SIG is active and is working towards stabilization. Not sure if gRPC is involved.  \\n\\n### Stabilization of otelhttp\\n\\n- Damien proposed starting an API audit for otelhttp to move towards stabilization.\\n\\n- A known bug (issue #7254) may be the only blocker; it’s a behavioral change around how errors are marked (events vs attributes) and interacts with semconv/spec wording.\\n\\n- Agreement:\\n\\n  - Begin the API review.\\n\\n  - Robert will take ownership of #7254 and draft a document clarifying interpretation and proposed resolution.\\n\\n  - The existence of bugs does not inherently block stabilization; they can be fixed post-stabilization if changes are non-breaking or properly versioned.\\n\\nReferences:\\n\\n- Blocker (only one I think): [https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/7254](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/7254)  \\n\\n### OTel Explorer Go docs\\n\\n- Mike outlined a project to revamp the OTEL registry/explorer with a schema that documents spans/metrics emitted by instrumentations, aiming to render via Hugo and enable static analysis across Go SDKs and contrib modules.\\n\\n- Tyler’s feedback:\\n\\n  - Strong requirement: align schema with semantic conventions and ensure it’s compatible with Weaver (to enable validation and transformations across versions).\\n\\n  - Consider providing a JSON Schema (or CUE) for validation and potentially linking to existing semconv definitions to keep the spec concise.\\n\\n  - Scope can include eBPF/auto-instrumentation; representation should still fit the schema as long as it maps to OTEL signals.\\n\\n- Mike will iterate on the schema, explore Weaver integration, and coordinate with SIGs as needed.\\n\\nReferences:\\n\\n  - Context: [https://github.com/open-telemetry/community/pull/3000](https://github.com/open-telemetry/community/pull/3000)  \\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"seek more engag from grpc attempt in person convers at kubecon if possibl david will sync with josh on outreach conclus not like to stabil this year set a goal to final a strategi next year onc semconv progress is clearer refer stabil of otelgrpc http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 8078 relat http github com grpc grpc go issu 8265 http github com grpc grpc go issu 8265 we need the semconv to stabil there need to be involv from grpc to progress this david updat i m told that the sig is activ and is work toward stabil not sure if grpc is involv stabil of otelhttp damien propos start an api audit for otelhttp to move toward stabil a known bug issu 7254 may be the onli blocker it s a behavior chang around how error are mark event v attribut and interact with semconv spec word agreement begin the api review robert will take ownership of 7254 and draft a document clarifi interpret and propos resolut the exist of bug doe not inher block stabil they can be fix post stabil if chang are non break or proper version refer blocker onli one i think http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 7254 http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 7254 otel explor go doc mike outlin a project to revamp the otel registri explor with a schema that document span metric emit by instrument aim to render via hugo and enabl static analysi across go sdks and contrib modul tyler s feedback strong requir align schema with semant convent and ensur it s compat with weaver to enabl valid and transform across version consid provid a json schema or cue for valid and potenti link to exist semconv definit to keep the spec concis scope can includ ebpf auto instrument represent should still fit the schema a long a it map to otel signal mike will iter on the schema explor weaver integr and coordin with sig a need refer context http github com open telemetri communiti pull 3000 http github com open telemetri communiti pull 3000\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"874039c68a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479655348.md\", \"id\": \"5449cc5184194ce6\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2647030498073576, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.05403944972479657, \"vector_similarity\": 0.75625145, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479655348.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"874039c68a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479655348.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3479655348.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 7597, \"chunk_count\": 4, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:24\", \"token_count\": 1926, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-27  \\n\\n## Decisions\\n\\n- Do **not** merge large public API changes without prior issue discussion.\\n\\n- Proceed incrementally:\\n\\n  - Start with a small change (e.g., ability to disable runtime tracer integration).\\n\\n- Open an issue to document the profiling proposal before continuing API changes.\\n\\n- Keep current large PR as draft/proof of concept.\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-08]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2026-02-27\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3974113940  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2026-02-27T17:20:46Z · **Updated**: 2026-02-27T17:21:05Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-27  \\n\\n## Action Items\\n\\n- [ ] Nico Hertz:\\n\\n  - Open an issue describing the runtime profiling problem and proposal (modes, semantics, trade-offs).\\n\\n  - Create a smaller PR to allow disabling runtime tracer integration.\\n\\n  - Explore flaky test issues in `contrib`.\\n\\n- [ ] Maintainers:\\n\\n  - Provide onboarding support (buddy/help via Slack) for new contributors.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"date 2025 11 27 decis do not merg larg public api chang without prior issu discuss proceed increment start with a small chang e g abil to disabl runtim tracer integr open an issu to document the profil propos befor continu api chang keep current larg pr a draft proof of concept sourc id src note 08 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2026 02 27 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3974113940 author pellar creat 2026 02 27t17 20 46z updat 2026 02 27t17 21 05z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 11 27 action item nico hertz open an issu describ the runtim profil problem and propos mode semant trade off creat a smaller pr to allow disabl runtim tracer integr explor flaki test issu in contrib maintain provid onboard support buddi help via slack for new contributor\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8738b66a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md\", \"id\": \"9b5b6f01e95cbce3\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.26426285384266074, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.05417454834665821, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7544689, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8738b66a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 3929, \"chunk_count\": 3, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:30\", \"token_count\": 1330, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"After discussing it at the 23-OCT SIG call, the decision is in the short term to include this in an `init` function in the otelconf package that will automatically configure the SDK components\\n\\n---\\n\\n**dashpole** — 2025-12-04T18:32:17Z\\n\\n> in the short term to include this in an init function in the otelconf package\\n\\nOut of curiosity, what is the long-term plan?\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-ISSUE-05]\\n\\n# Issue: otelconf: add support for OTEL_EXPERIMENT